	(text "This board adapts lattice's ECP5 dev board headers\nto connectors that go to my Himax image sensor breakout \nboards.\nIt \n - provides 2v8 for the image sensor (either an LDO or switching reg)\n - provides vccio (selectable from 3v3, 2v8, 2v5, or 1v8)\n - provides optional i2c pins\n - connects FPGA i/o pins"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 23.876 0)
